# .gitignore — Estate pen.
#
# Submoduleless by design: product checkouts live under products/ as peer
# standalone clones and are NEVER tracked by this repo. No gitlinks (mode
# 160000), no nested .git pollution in the index.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!package.json
!mise.toml
!AGENTS.md
!bin/
!bin/**
!docs/
!docs/**
# Live control-plane config: pitchfork loads this namespace's pitchfork.toml
# (see ~/.config/pitchfork/config.toml -> [namespaces.estate]). Track it so the
# running supervisor's source of truth is versioned, not orphaned on disk.
!pitchfork.toml
!config/
!config/ports.env
